# calls.jsonl - paper calls logged by the decision bots, one JSON object per line.
# Format: {"bot", "ts", "ticker", "side" (buy|short|exit), "qty_ref" (fixed 10000 reference size), "entry_price", "reason"}
# For an exit call, entry_price is the price when the exit was logged: it closes that bot's open call on the ticker, or scores as a defensive call (move avoided) if none is open.
# Paper only. THE BOARD (leaderboard.py) reads this file. Rankings start Monday shadow mode; no calls are logged by test runs.
